        "content": "## Weekly property auction deals to Google Sheets\n\nEvery Monday: new court, bank and government auction lots near your place, and lots whose price or date changed, scored against similar lots and your budget.\n\n1. **Run auctions-radar** > Header Auth credential, `Authorization: Bearer <your Apify token>`.\n2. Change the JSON body to your own search.\n3. **Append to Google Sheet** > connect Google, paste your sheet URL.\n4. Activate the workflow.\n\nNo Apify account yet? Free plan: https://console.apify.com/sign-up",
